        {
          "body": {
            "col_1": {
              "content": "<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #444444;\">\"We ran a highly competitive pilot program against two competitors for several different trades. With a focus on cost management and exceptional service, we were able to show our capabilities to deliver results.\"</span></strong></h4>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"color: #444444;\">- VP, Client Relations at Vixxo</span></strong></h4>",
