        {
          "body": {
            "col_1": {
              "content": "<h2><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">The Situation</span></h2>\n<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">The client had undergone leadership changes related to their facility management and maintenance functions.</span><br><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">While they traditionally self-performed their maintenance, they needed to quickly stand up a solid and comprehensive facilities maintenance program with trade expertise and depth of coverage.</span><br><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">A detailed search process to seek out qualified and experienced potential partners was started.</span>",
              "settings": {
                "align_desktop": "left",
                "align_mobile": "left",
                "show_divider": false
              }
            },
            "col_2": {
              "content": "",
              "settings": {
                "align_desktop": "left",
                "align_mobile": "left",
                "show_divider": false
              }
            },
            "extra_wrapper_attrs": {},
