        {
          "body": {
            "col_1": {
              "content": "<h2><span>The Challenge</span></h2>\n<p>The client wanted to pivot and optimize their facility management operations without losing the best of their existing systems and processes.</p>\n<p>They wanted to compare different vendors over a 90-day period to find the best partner but didn't want the complexity, cost overruns, and inconsistent service that often comes with different vendors running different systems at the same time.</p>\n<p>The pilot approach would provide them the data needed to assess the ability of the potential candidates to meet their needs, then make an informed decision.</p>",
              "settings": {
                "align_desktop": "right",
                "align_mobile": "right",
                "show_divider": false
              }
            },
            "row_settings": {
              "adv_settings": {
                "padding_bottom": "25px"
              }
            }
          },
          "child_css": {},
          "css": {},
          "id": 1604328170347,
          "module_id": 4148708,
          "order": 5,
          "styles": {},
          "type": "module"
        },
        {
          "body": {
            "col_1": {
              "content": "<h2><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">The Solution</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Vixxo quickly assessed the geographic areas involved and developed a detailed plan to support the stores and ensure costs were contained, service levels were optimized, and systems were simplified.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">The store\u2019s assets were reviewed, as well as their historical data on repair and maintenance volumes.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">A detailed service provider coverage plan was created, aligning experienced providers and multiple levels backup coverage, by trade based on the store\u2019s assets.</span></p>",
              "settings": {
                "align_desktop": "left",
                "align_mobile": "left",
                "show_divider": false
              }
            },
            "col_2": {
              "content": "",
              "settings": {
                "align_desktop": "left",
                "align_mobile": "left",
                "show_divider": true
              }
            },
            "row_settings": {
              "adv_settings": {
                "padding_bottom": "25px"
              },
              "bg_color": {
                "color": "#217A81",
                "opacity": 100
              }
            },
            "start": {
              "num_cols": "1"
            }
          },
          "child_css": {},
          "css": {},
          "id": 1604325024073,
          "module_id": 4148708,
          "order": 6,
          "styles": {},
          "type": "module"
        },
        {
          "body": {
            "col_1": {
              "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>Results Delivered</span></h2>",
              "settings": {
                "align_desktop": "center",
                "align_mobile": "center",
                "show_divider": true
              }
            },
            "row_settings": {
              "adv_settings": {
                "padding_bottom": "10px",
                "padding_top": "10px"
              }
            }
          },
          "child_css": {},
          "css": {},
          "id": 1604328180872,
          "module_id": 4148708,
          "order": 7,
          "styles": {},
          "type": "module"
        },
        {
          "body": {
            "content_group": {
              "column_1": {
                "content": "<h2>4.3%</h2>\n<p>savings per plumbing work order (on average)</p>",
                "icon_hs": {
                  "name": "check",
                  "set": "fontawesome-5",
                  "type": "SOLID",
                  "unicode": "f00c"
                }
              },
              "column_2": {
                "content": "<h2>80%</h2>\n<p>service calls completed on time</p>",
                "icon_hs": {
                  "name": "check",
                  "set": "fontawesome-5",
                  "type": "SOLID",
                  "unicode": "f00c"
                }
              },
              "column_3": {
                "content": "<h2>84%</h2>\n<p>service calls completed on first visit</p>",
                "icon_hs": {
                  "name": "check",
                  "set": "fontawesome-5",
                  "type": "SOLID",
                  "unicode": "f00c"
                }
              }
            },
            "row_settings": {
              "adv_settings": {
                "padding_bottom": "25px",
                "padding_top": "25px"
              }
            }
          },
          "child_css": {},
          "css": {},
          "id": 1604325448327,
          "module_id": 4127074,
          "order": 8,
          "styles": {},
          "type": "module"
        },
        {
          "body": {
            "col_1": {
              "content": "<p>As a result of the pilot, total R&amp;M spend came in under budget and the average cost of a work order was less than prior years when the company self-performed.</p>\n<p>Vixxo\u2019s focus on cost management and exceptional service in the pilot demonstrated our ability to achieve a reduction in call volume \u2013 and when there were calls, fewer return visits.</p>",
              "settings": {
                "align_desktop": "left",
                "align_mobile": "left",
                "show_divider": false
              }
            },
            "row_settings": {
              "adv_settings": {
                "padding_top": "25px"
              }
            }
          },
          "child_css": {},
          "css": {},
